      "receiptId": "scalloped-potato.html-1",
      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Experienced English Housekeeper\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by Elizabeth Raffald (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#raffald-1769\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERaffald 1769\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E)",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo Scallop Potatoes.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nBoil your Potatoes, then beat them fine in a Bowl with good Cream, a Lump of Butter and Salt, put them into scollop\u0027d Shells, make them smooth on the Top, score them with a Knife, lay thin Slices of Butter on the Top of them, put them in a Dutch Oven to brown before the Fire. - Three Shells is enough for a Dish\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
  ],
